            <ArticleTitle>Eosinophilic gastroenteritis--a rare cause of severe abdominal pain. Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>225-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 48-year-old man with a long history of recurrent severe abdominal pain developed moderate drug dependence before the diagnosis of eosinophilic gastroenteritis was established. The symptoms quickly responded to corticosteroid treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
